# A chord matches only a binding with exactly its modifiers. Mod plus a key
# of the mask itself (Mod+Mod4+q under Mod4, Mod+Ctrl+h under Ctrl+Alt) can
# never be pressed apart from Mod+q / Mod+h, so it never fires and never
# takes over when that binding is removed.
mod Mod4
defaults
bind Mod+Mod4+q once spawn
k F868
k F868 71
K F868
K
unbind Mod+q
k F868
k F868 71
c 71
K F868
K
mod Ctrl+Alt
unbind Mod+h
k F015
k F015 F017
k F015 F017 8
c 8
K F015 F017
K
mod Mod4+Ctrl
unbind Mod+l
k F868
k F868 F017
k F868 F017 C
c C
K F868 F017
K
